Spec: Invoice Demo CLI

Platform: Python 3

Purpose:
  Provide a minimal adapter that exercises the invoice service manually.

Structure:
  ./cli.py: Command-line adapter.
  ./service.py: Service dependency.
  ./repository.py: Repository dependency.

Owns:
  ./cli.py
  ./cli.sdd

Can modify:
  ./cli.py
  ./cli.sdd

Can read:
  ./service.py
  ./repository.py

Must:
  Instantiate @invoice_demo.repository.InvoiceRepository.
  Instantiate @invoice_demo.service.InvoiceService.
  Create one deterministic demo invoice request.
  Return display text instead of performing complex presentation logic.

Must not:
  Parse command-line flags.
  Read environment variables.
  Add external dependencies.

Depends on:
  @invoice_demo.repository.InvoiceRepository
  @invoice_demo.service.InvoiceService

Scenario: demo invoice can be created
  Given the adapter is run as a script
  When @invoice_demo.cli.create_demo_invoice calls the service
  Then a display string contains the invoice id and total
